---
import type { ImageMetadata } from 'astro';

interface Props {
	image: ImageMetadata;
}

const { image } = Astro.props;
---

<article class="about-section">
    <div class="about-content">
        <p class="about-description">
            I'm <b>Santi Montiel</b>, a PhD student at the University of Alcalá,
            Madrid, Spain. Currently focused on crafting Camera-RADAR fusion
            Deep Learning models as part of my research.
            <br /><br />

            With a former background in Industrial Engineering and Robotics, I
            decided to pursue a PhD in the intersection of Autonomous Driving
            and Deep Learning, entitled <b
                >Deep Learning based on Camera-RADAR Fusion for Perception in
                Autonomous Driving</b
            >, under the supervision of <a
                href="http://www.robesafe.uah.es/personal/bergasa/"
                >Prof. Luis M. Bergasa</a
            > and <a href="https://allamazares.jimdofree.com/"
                >Dr. Ángel Llamazares</a
            >, at the <b>RobeSafe Research Group</b> of
            <a href="https://www.uah.es/"><b>University of Alcalá</b></a>. I carried
            out a research internship at the <b>Intelligent Vehicles Lab</b> of
            <a href="https://www.tudelft.nl/en/"
                ><b>Delft University of Technology</b></a
            >, under the supervision of <a
                href="https://sites.google.com/it-caesar.de/homepage/"
                >Dr. Holger Caesar</a
            >.
        </p>

        <p class="about-more-label">Some more about me:</p>
        <ul class="about-bullets">
            <li class="about-bullet">
                <span class="about-bullet-icon">🤖</span>
                <span>Former team member of UAH Robotics Team, speaker at ROSCon Spain.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="about-bullet">
                <span class="about-bullet-icon">🤝</span>
                <span>Always open to research collaborations! Feel free to get in touch
                with ideas.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="about-bullet">
                <span class="about-bullet-icon">🎾</span>
                <span>Outside research and coding, I enjoy video games, running, and
                pádel.</span>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="about-contact">
            <span class="about-bullet-icon">📩</span>
            <span>Contact: <a href="mailto:santiago.montiel@uah.es"
                >santiago.montiel@uah.es</a
            ></span>
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-image">
        <img src={image.src} alt="Profile picture" />
    </div>
</article>

<style>
    .about-section {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .about-image img {
        width: 300px;
        height: 360px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .about-content {
        flex: 1;
    }

    .about-title {
        margin: 0.2rem 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .about-description {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        text-align: justify;
    }

    .about-description b {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .about-description a b {
        color: var(--accent-300);
    }

    .about-more-label {
        margin: 1em 0 0.5em 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .about-bullets {
        list-style-type: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 1em 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5em;
    }

    .about-bullet {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.75em;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .about-bullet-icon {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 1.9em;
        height: 1.9em;
        border-radius: var(--radius-full);
        background: var(--bg-surface-sunken);
    }

    .about-contact {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75em;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* Responsive design */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-section {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-image {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            order: 2; /* Ensures image comes after content */
        }

        .about-content {
            order: 1; /* Ensures content comes first */
        }

        .about-image img {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 300px;
            max-width: 300px;
            height: auto;
        }
    }
</style>
